  "body": "Hey there,\nI hope this is the right place to ask this: I've looked far and wide but there just isn't a lot of information about the webserial API online so I was wondering: Does the API officially support connecting to multiple serial devices in the same browser tab and communicating with them simultaneously?\nif this is not the case, I'd like to request this as a new feature since I don't see why you shouldn't be able to do it.\nThanks!",
